# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Habito — Supabase connection
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT: Expo only inlines variables whose names start with `EXPO_PUBLIC_`
# into the JavaScript bundle. The Next.js convention (`NEXT_PUBLIC_*`) is NOT
# recognised by Metro — `process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_...` would resolve to
# `undefined` at runtime and the client would fail to initialise.
#
# SECURITY: only the *publishable* key belongs here. It is designed to ship
# inside client apps and its power is limited entirely by your Postgres RLS
# policies. NEVER place the `service_role` key (or any secret) in this file —
# it bypasses RLS and anyone who unzips the app would own your database.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://zjpbctulcpwiyaydqwxo.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_7jhVwdGBO059f08sd_HWOw_RzGlZpQ-